@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@bookId = 1
@adminAuth = YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
@userAuth = dXNlcjp1c2Vy
@superadminAuth = c3VwZXJhZG1pbjpzdXBlcmFkbWlu

### SETUP: GET CSRF TOKEN (not counted)
# @name getCsrfToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csrf-token
Authorization: Basic {{adminAuth}}

> {% client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token); %}

###

### 1. ADMIN creates a book -> 201 (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") on POST /api/books)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{adminAuth}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "title": "The Left Hand of Darkness",
  "author": "Ursula K. Le Guin",
  "status": "TO_READ"
}

> {% client.global.set("bookId", response.body.id); %}

###

### 2. USER lists books -> 200 (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER','ADMIN')") on GET /api/books)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Basic {{userAuth}}

###

### 3. SUPERADMIN lists books -> 403 (no USER/ADMIN role, denied by annotation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Basic {{superadminAuth}}

###

### 4. ADMIN reads one book -> 200 (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER','ADMIN')") on GET /api/books/{id})
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Basic {{adminAuth}}

###

### 5. USER tries to update a book -> 403 (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") on PUT /api/books/{id})
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{userAuth}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "title": "The Left Hand of Darkness",
  "author": "Ursula K. Le Guin",
  "status": "READING"
}

###

### 6. ADMIN updates a book -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{adminAuth}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "title": "The Left Hand of Darkness",
  "author": "Ursula K. Le Guin",
  "status": "READING"
}

###

### 7. USER tries to delete a book -> 403 (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") on DELETE /api/books/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Basic {{userAuth}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

###

### 8. ADMIN accesses admin-only route -> 200 (class-level @PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')") on AdminController)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/hello
Authorization: Basic {{adminAuth}}

###

### 9. USER accesses admin-only route -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/hello
Authorization: Basic {{userAuth}}

###

### 10. SUPERADMIN accesses superadmin-only route -> 200 (class-level @PreAuthorize("hasRole('SUPERADMIN')") on SuperAdminController)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/superadmin/hello
Authorization: Basic {{superadminAuth}}
